Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.46,0:00:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on a journey out to see the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.32,0:00:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,While I'm on my own, I've\Nyet to reach the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.34,0:00:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So won't you come along with me right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.20,0:00:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely then, WE CAN!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.86,0:00:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me now as we\Njourney on from sea to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,For that treasure known\Nby everybody as one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.42,0:00:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though they laugh and\Nsay it's just a fantasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.66,0:00:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We are going, there's no doubt we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.94,0:00:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we can feel the\Nrush of energy overcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.06,0:00:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It will lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.30,0:00:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep pretending that you know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Books will only get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.48,0:01:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No guides for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.14,0:01:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not worry, soon the rain\Nwill be gone with the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.06,0:01:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your chin up, raise the\Nanchor, now that's what you'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.68,0:01:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it time and calm the storm\Nthat you have built within.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.36,0:01:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and have not forget number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.48,0:01:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Once tomorrow's wind picks up,\Nwe set self cause we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.84,0:01:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thresh enough, stand tall and\Ntake a look at one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.36,0:01:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All the journey makes\Nme wanna see somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.74,0:01:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There are things out there\Nyou just won't believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.70,0:01:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.64,0:01:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.38,0:01:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.84,0:01:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the story most will believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.50,0:01:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Not me, come and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.28,0:01:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I am on a journey out to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.84,0:01:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The world done on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.40,0:01:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got my group of friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.42,0:01:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Together we've got our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.46,0:01:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.04,0:01:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Says your captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.10,0:01:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Who says it can't be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.36,0:01:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't even tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.02,0:01:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta just believe we'll\Nmake it to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.02,0:01:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanna do it all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.66,0:02:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Together surely we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.92,0:02:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.80,0:02:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.18,0:02:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take this moment in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.92,0:02:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.14,0:02:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.52,0:02:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take this feeling in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.28,0:02:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.56,0:02:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.78,0:02:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yes, we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.44,0:02:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.36,0:02:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.46,0:02:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It belonged to Shanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.14,0:02:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you know about that guy, Cat Viper.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.68,0:02:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Very much so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.88,0:02:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Goes by red-haired Shanks, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.14,0:02:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Too funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.30,0:02:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder why that Straw Hat\Nwas looking so familiar to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.84,0:02:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.02,0:02:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.93,0:02:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You said the same thing, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.32,0:02:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you pals with Shanks back in the day?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.88,0:02:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed we were.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.10,0:02:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The Cat and I traveled alongside\Nhe and Roger many years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.10,0:03:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.01,0:03:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You were a part of the\NPirate King's crew, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.68,0:03:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Part of the crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.20,0:03:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose that would be\None way of putting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.06,0:03:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We accompanied Lord Odin, serving as\Nhis retainers everywhere that he went.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.04,0:03:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We even once sailed on\NWhitebeard's ship, the Moby Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.08,0:03:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So when Lord Odin was recruited by\NRoger, we naturally escorted him as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.16,0:03:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.07,0:03:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.54,0:03:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.76,0:03:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We were all rather young back then. So,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.90,0:03:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,generationally speaking,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.16,0:03:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,we were still apprentices around\Nthe ages of shanks or buggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.94,0:03:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.14,0:03:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm having a little trouble\Nkeeping up with all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.78,0:03:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.14,0:03:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We weren't always with him, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.02,0:03:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't join those guys when\Nthey made it to Laugh Tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.90,0:03:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I said slow it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.22,0:03:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, so first there was\NWhitebeard's ship, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.56,0:04:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And you said on it was Odin\Nand the dog and the cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.60,0:04:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Odin was recruited by Roger,\Nand he took you two with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.62,0:04:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I miss anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.53,0:04:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember it quite clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.54,0:04:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We had so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.84,0:04:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Those were the days.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.24,0:04:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We encountered so many unknown\Nspecies, lands, and climates.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.58,0:04:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A sea of clouds in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.12,0:04:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,An underwater island where the sun shone\Nevery day was an exciting new adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.08,0:04:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We really shared some\Ngood times, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.30,0:04:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up, aren't you two just\Nin each other's throats?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.42,0:04:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And you did, you and the other somata—I\Nget to ride on whitebeard's ship too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.12,0:04:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,too Alas, we remained\Nat home back in Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.72,0:05:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Truth be told, we did all we could\Nto block Lord Odin from leaving home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.06,0:05:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, that was in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.24,0:05:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So strictly,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.16,0:05:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,in fact, that even stepping foot outside\Nits perimeter is considered a felony.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.68,0:05:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Odin was somewhat\Nof a malcontent, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.56,0:05:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He was not shy about expressing his doubts
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.80,0:05:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,about the restrictions\Nsegregating our home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.44,0:05:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Driven by this, he sought camaraderie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.92,0:05:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,With Whitebeard, Roger, and their\Ncrews when they arrived in Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.16,0:05:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly speaking here, they were\Nhonorable men, far from wicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.36,0:05:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet if we allowed him to sail\Nwith them, there'd be outrage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.42,0:05:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So our duty was clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.18,0:05:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, anyway, that means you're\Nall buddies with Shanks then, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.16,0:05:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And Rayleigh too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.18,0:05:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.72,0:05:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If you got to ride on Roger's ship, that\Nmeans it was the Alabasta then, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.00,0:05:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That was built by the shipwright\NTom, who I apprenticed under.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.60,0:05:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.51,0:05:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.43,0:05:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna really Tom's pupil?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.44,0:06:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If I may please interject, then\Nyou must also know they're Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.14,0:06:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Crow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.05,0:06:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,One sec, Brooke.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.97,0:06:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to cut you off like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.92,0:06:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to confirm something real quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.10,0:06:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.24,0:06:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Before we proceed, I have a concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.68,0:06:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You said the road Poneglyph will\Nlead us to Laugh Tale, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.52,0:06:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a bit worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.08,0:06:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure about this route?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.64,0:06:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.98,0:06:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,See the log post needles?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.88,0:06:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, usually,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.18,0:06:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,to navigate to our next destination,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.04,0:06:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,we use the location that these\Nthree are pointing towards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.64,0:06:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we continue to track them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.92,0:06:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,After Dressrosa, we followed Traffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.42,0:06:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out his Viva card was\Nwhat led us straight to Zoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.98,0:06:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we happened upon the road Poneglyph,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.68,0:06:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,which also coincidentally\Npoints to Laugh Tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.52,0:07:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,However, according to Crocus\Nback at the Twin Capes,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.84,0:07:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,if you track the logs,\Nevery single pathway
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.14,0:07:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,will eventually converge into one trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.36,0:07:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I pretty much always assumed\Nthat's where Laugh Tale would
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.82,0:07:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,be located.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.73,0:07:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you gotta know Crocus?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.72,0:07:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that guy doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.80,0:07:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been ages since I've seen him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.34,0:07:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He was good when we last saw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.22,0:07:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That was around two years ago, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.12,0:07:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The old guy with the pet whale, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.98,0:07:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He was our ship's doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.98,0:07:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember that back in the day, he was\Nalways on the search for some pirate crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.34,0:07:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I bet that was mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.04,0:07:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they're all dead now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.88,0:07:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, enough with the chit-chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.88,0:07:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to talk about\Nsomething serious here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.24,0:07:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.15,0:07:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand your concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.02,0:07:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If you Karoo are curious to see where\Nthe log post leads your crew next,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.40,0:07:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,well, I do encourage following\Nit if you Karoo so choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.48,0:08:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There is certainly a location in which\Nall three needles are pointing towards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.80,0:08:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.71,0:08:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I know for a fact that your journey lies\Nbeyond that position it's steering towards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.52,0:08:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.50,0:08:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Usually, when one reaches the log's end\Npoint, they have a bit of a revelation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.34,0:08:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They arrive at a truth about the ancient\Nwriting inscribed on the Poneglyph.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.08,0:08:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And the civilization that created them,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.24,0:08:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,as well as the existence of\Nthe unseen island, Laugh Tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.98,0:08:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,When Roger reached that point, he\Nhad to start his adventure anew.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.42,0:08:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The crocus Yugara mentioned was\Nalso part of the Pirate King's crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.98,0:08:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a real Noodle type.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.04,0:09:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He would not tell a lie unless\Nhe wasn't fond of someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.06,0:09:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.24,0:09:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So there really was no need for\Nme to worry in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.58,0:09:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We weren't actually\Nfalling off course at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.80,0:09:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Until now, I only had a piece\Nof a much larger puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.20,0:09:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.48,0:09:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't need to doubt the Log Pose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.74,0:09:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a very sharp mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.98,0:09:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Fit for a navigator. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.84,0:09:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to fret.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.96,0:09:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You got her on the correct path.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.18,0:09:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Have faith in your own talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.48,0:09:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.00,0:09:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't follow any of that junk,\Nbut it sounds like you did, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.34,0:09:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thing you're so smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.86,0:09:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He said I had a sharp mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.82,0:09:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, obviously, but come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.92,0:09:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.83,0:09:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Three cheers to the awesome\Nnavigator of the next pirate game!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.40,0:09:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami is super cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.12,0:10:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you knock that off?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.62,0:10:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.08,0:10:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like all of you\Ngot our wonderful friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.62,0:10:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, you guys have so many\Nconnections to all these legends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.08,0:10:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It was hard trying to keep up,\Njust like when we met Rayleigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.86,0:10:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I also had the honor of\Nmeeting Roger and his crew,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.78,0:10:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,but I was quite young at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.56,0:10:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So I hardly remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.80,0:10:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that a shame?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.14,0:10:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.24,0:10:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He died over two decades ago, liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.96,0:10:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't trick me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.40,0:10:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So much happened on our\Nadventures with Lord Odin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.22,0:10:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Remind me to go in-depth\Nabout it sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.62,0:10:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, we have many loose ends to tie\Nup before we come face-to-face with Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.60,0:10:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, we have much to prepare.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.00,0:10:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,As I previously cited,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.62,0:10:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,in our home country of Wano,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.90,0:11:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We are currently recruiting some\Nand I who will fight for our cause
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.72,0:11:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and in the meantime I would like to\Nget in touch with a certain someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.02,0:11:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It never hurts to have even more\Nmanpower at your disposal. Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.50,0:11:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the former commander of the\NWhitebeard Pirates first division.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.92,0:11:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Marco the Phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.34,0:11:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Marco?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.34,0:11:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.28,0:11:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I never expected\Nhis name to come up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.60,0:11:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He's Marco.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.51,0:11:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.43,0:11:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are actually friends with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.20,0:11:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You think he'll actually come help?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.74,0:11:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,If he can lend a hand for the cause, I'd\Nfeel so much better about our chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.12,0:11:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up just a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.78,0:11:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,After what happened with him\Nlast year, he might be...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.90,0:11:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, it's a long shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.22,0:11:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He may not agree, even if we locate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.90,0:12:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Marco, Marco, I know I\Nheard that name somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.12,0:12:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, maybe you met him back\Nin the War of the Best?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.50,0:12:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He was at Marineford, after all. Marco?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.04,0:12:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he has a very\Nrare Devil Fruit power.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.78,0:12:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that ring any bells?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.50,0:12:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.41,0:12:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Rare power?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.06,0:12:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks like a pineapple.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.56,0:12:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.92,0:12:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He was involved in a\Nbattle. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.18,0:12:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.09,0:12:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,there was a clash involving\Nthe remnants of the Whitebeard
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.82,0:12:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirates versus the Blackbeard\NPirates about a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.40,0:12:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The world refers to it as the Grudge War.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.42,0:12:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But since the fight, the commander\Nand his folks have been disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.16,0:12:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If Marco's still alive, I've got\Na good idea where he might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.14,0:12:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So, let's see if my hunch is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.24,0:12:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa! Back up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.16,0:12:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They fought with Blackbeard last year?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.04,0:12:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.00,0:12:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a massive confrontation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.44,0:13:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Both sides brought reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.96,0:13:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Marco, in the end, was defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.46,0:13:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Afterwards, Blackbeard received his\Nrecognition as one of the Four Emperors.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.08,0:13:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.62,0:13:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackbeard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.53,0:13:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.45,0:13:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How did this war go over your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.72,0:13:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you possibly be that\Ndisconnected from the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.92,0:13:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I do remember one thing Jinbe told\Nme after the war in Marineford.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.74,0:13:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,When I blacked out in that fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.70,0:13:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,some of Whitebeard's crew\Nstepped in and saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.26,0:13:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, we cannot give in to despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.48,0:13:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, carry Straw Hat, if\Nyou won't run! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.32,0:14:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see him again and say thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.70,0:14:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we'll be busy—if we're\Ndoing this thing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.80,0:14:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll need some time to\Nget our ducks in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.36,0:14:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreed?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.27,0:14:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.56,0:14:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should split up for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.10,0:14:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,In my case, I shall\Ngather more compatriots.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.84,0:14:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll head to Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.60,0:14:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm—are you sure that's a good idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.22,0:14:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't the Shogun after you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.48,0:14:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We are also heavy with concern\Nfor our companions back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.40,0:14:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If you traveled there on our submarine,\Nyou'd be pretty safe, wouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.80,0:14:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But you'd still need to find cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.70,0:14:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,find cover once you make it to the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.72,0:14:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.60,0:14:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, in that case, I'll\Ngo and find Marco myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.26,0:14:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Our final targets are\Nthe Shogun and Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.92,0:14:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And conveniently, they\Nboth reside in Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.22,0:14:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll meet there and\Nprepare for war. Agreed?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.54,0:14:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's whip up a Vivi card\Nfor Kin'emon as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.58,0:14:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, then. He's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.48,0:14:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.14,0:15:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.94,0:15:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm delighted to see you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.44,0:15:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.84,0:15:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.24,0:15:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Care to join us for a banquet?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.54,0:15:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We've already prepared it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.76,0:15:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Why now, a banquet?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.72,0:15:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What occasion calls for such festivities?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.60,0:15:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Serious is in good health!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.20,0:15:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of our kings have\Nended their quarrel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.38,0:15:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Kozuki clan has\Ncome together again!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.80,0:15:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.46,0:15:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.50,0:15:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse every one of you, Minx!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.72,0:15:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about the locked up thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.14,0:15:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No hard feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.64,0:15:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We had to protect Yugara\Nfrom Jack. Mr. Race!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.06,0:15:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We tied your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.24,0:15:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope we didn't hurt you, Tia. Sir Race!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.56,0:16:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Big ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.48,0:16:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, Peckney!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.86,0:16:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.44,0:16:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.18,0:16:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.02,0:16:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.93,0:16:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to eat up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.92,0:16:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Dinner time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.28,0:16:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Dinner time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.42,0:16:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Dinner time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.60,0:16:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Dinner time! Dinner time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.44,0:16:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a sec, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.00,0:16:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They already threw us a giant feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.66,0:16:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your priority?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.74,0:16:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Gorging yourself or helping\Na Gourmet in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.82,0:16:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you coming with me? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.66,0:16:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel partially responsible\Nfor this whole mess after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.32,0:16:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, how are you going to sail\Nwithout a new world navigator?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.96,0:16:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, can you, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.26,0:16:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.78,0:16:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Peck-Oms is severely injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.60,0:16:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.06,0:17:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And I.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.86,0:17:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,For who will soothe your soul with the\Ngift of song, when the world gets you down?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.94,0:17:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go meet master cat viper;
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.36,0:17:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,he will know what to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.28,0:17:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we'll be fine\Nwithout you—how cruel?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.00,0:17:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about how I feel on the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.46,0:17:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of us allowed them to escort Sanji\Naway, so how am I supposed to cope?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.54,0:17:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take them with me, kinemon—that\Ncool, they're your crewmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.82,0:17:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.73,0:17:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,i would not dare challenge you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.26,0:17:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,In truth, I wish I could\Nassist you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.28,0:17:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Alas, I have a duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.08,0:17:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That said, this decision pains me terribly,\Nas I carry my own debt to Sir Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.70,0:17:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.30,0:17:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, guys, if you add any more\Npeople, this plan's gonna get sloppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.64,0:17:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,After you bust up that wedding,\Njust haul ass on out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.50,0:17:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.56,0:17:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll hang out with Kin'emon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.00,0:17:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go! Save Sanji! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.34,0:17:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it! Oh, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.70,0:18:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,One thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.84,0:18:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you bring back a pony glyph rubbing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.96,0:18:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Captain. Pretty\Nplease? Sure thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.34,0:18:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That was really cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.84,0:18:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's perfect! Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.92,0:18:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll check out the one Kaido\Nhas, with any luck. Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.70,0:18:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So, are we good then?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.46,0:18:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we eat now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.02,0:18:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.10,0:18:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.36,0:18:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.64,0:18:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are we freaking out?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.76,0:18:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoe's shaking!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.52,0:19:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That sound was Zunesha's cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.48,0:19:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What caused this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.64,0:19:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's Zunesha? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.70,0:19:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The island.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.34,0:19:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's the elephant's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.94,0:19:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's trembling like never before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.16,0:19:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you go to stand? Give\Nme your paw. Easy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.20,0:19:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.08,0:19:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.44,0:19:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster! That's gonna fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.32,0:19:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here! Keep running!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.82,0:19:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on to the trees. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.18,0:19:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.70,0:20:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, run.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.32,0:20:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Kara!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.24,0:20:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.70,0:20:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.14,0:20:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be good. What\Nhappened to Zunisha?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.54,0:20:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are here...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.74,0:20:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.14,0:20:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The voice is speaking again!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.52,0:20:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.50,0:20:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.08,0:20:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean? Can't you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.10,0:21:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I can't. Can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.52,0:21:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he able to hear it too?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.46,0:21:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Please be quick about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.54,0:21:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.64,0:21:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.96,0:21:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.34,0:21:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the loudest voice\NI've ever heard! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.86,0:21:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's working!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.88,0:21:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.52,0:21:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Even ordinary elephants\Npanic at the sight of a bee.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.64,0:21:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,As for this one, take a look at its body.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.56,0:21:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's really been\Nalive for a millennium,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.48,0:21:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,then its skin must have\Ngotten weak over time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.22,0:21:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A living legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.42,0:21:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I think not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.68,0:21:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a decaying sack of meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.40,0:21:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Open fire on the front left leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.20,0:22:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Increase the pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.46,0:22:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your aim steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.52,0:22:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can force it to its knees and draw\Nits head in closer, we can finish it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.12,0:22:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to go to ties\Nout, cut off its tongue,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.02,0:22:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,then rip its entrails\Nout as it lays, dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.92,0:22:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.83,0:22:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are there, give me an order!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.50,0:22:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,To do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.70,0:22:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.00,0:22:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop playing this game!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.76,0:22:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Just answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.56,0:23:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Both Gold D.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.47,0:23:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger and Lord Odin experienced\Na similar phenomenon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.90,0:23:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,They claimed to have heard a thunderous\Nvoice, but were unable to communicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.92,0:23:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.54,0:23:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.18,0:23:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.28,0:24:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.68,0:24:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My head...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.38,0:24:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, stop pounding!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.58,0:24:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.68,0:24:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Jack has returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.36,0:24:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.88,0:24:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He's attempting to\Nstrike down the elephant.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.22,0:24:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There are five ships attacking\Nthe leg at around nine o 'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.86,0:24:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That means Zunesha is under attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.18,0:24:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe that Jack has survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.46,0:24:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you figure all\Nthat stuff out, Momo?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.52,0:24:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.18,0:24:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.72,0:24:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.46,0:24:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It was clear as day!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.20,0:24:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to explain\Nit, but it came to my mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.56,0:25:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.84,0:25:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare the vessels!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.58,0:25:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall return fire against Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.74,0:25:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The pain is unbearable!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.36,0:25:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If I collapse,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.66,0:25:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,then you are all in grave danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.06,0:25:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The voice is speaking to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.72,0:25:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So, it's Zeff!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.96,0:26:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke, what is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.12,0:26:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.78,0:26:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Many years in the past, I committed...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.50,0:26:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago, the elephant\Nsaid he committed a crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.24,0:26:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And ever since, all he has permitted\Nto do is roam the seas as penance.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.54,0:26:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So he must continue to follow that order.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.14,0:26:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.78,0:26:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see his shuttle!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.98,0:26:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Blow it away!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.76,0:27:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So please, let me\Npermission, just this once?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.54,0:27:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That big stupid elephant\Nis gonna collapse!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.48,0:27:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me the honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.50,0:27:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,To fight back!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.18,0:27:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.62,0:27:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.34,0:27:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like your voice\Nwill be able to reach him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.24,0:27:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.58,0:27:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.24,0:27:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If he goes down, then we'll all drown.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.62,0:27:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt I could shout loud\Nenough for him to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.62,0:27:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.86,0:27:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The elephant's gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.96,0:28:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.62,0:28:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.32,0:28:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now stand your ground and fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.72,0:28:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear my plea!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.38,0:28:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish for you to finally\Nmake Jack go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.92,0:28:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.42,0:29:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's drunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.78,0:29:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Jack! We're playing!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.02,0:29:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.34,0:29:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Pete's supposed to be in the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.96,0:30:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They were abradicated!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.34,0:30:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,it's calm again what\Nhappened i cannot see nor
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.38,0:30:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,can i hear anything the\Npresence has left me
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.24,0:31:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing, so Zunisha used its\Nown trunk in self-defense that's
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.80,0:31:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,right and all it took was a single\Nblow i never imagined zunisha
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.12,0:31:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,had a will of its own much less\Nthat it could communicate with
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.86,0:31:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,us did lord odin know of this\Nability wielded by lord momonosuke
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.86,0:31:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.20,0:31:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.46,0:31:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Why all the long faces?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.08,0:31:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We're simply left speechless\Nby this sudden turn of events.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.98,0:31:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact of the matter is that if Jack\Nwas able to attack the island twice,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.40,0:31:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,then this place ain't as\Nsafe as it used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.22,0:31:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, good luck with that then.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.24,0:31:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be cool if that\Nelephant was on the team?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.10,0:31:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That simple, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.10,0:31:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we're about to take off now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.68,0:31:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we get some food before we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.98,0:32:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.00,0:32:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-pa-pa!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.12,0:32:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems our communication with\NJack was cut off rather abruptly.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.62,0:32:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What now, Kaido?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.70,0:32:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The knowledge of both\Nthe birdie and cherry
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.46,0:32:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,blossom kingdoms combined\Ninto one treatment,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.52,0:32:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,it's truly incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.46,0:32:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And the bleeding's completely subsided.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.14,0:32:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone did such a great job.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.38,0:33:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm going to leave you\Nguys with plenty of medicine,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.48,0:33:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,so you should be okay from here on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.42,0:33:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing we had Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.72,0:33:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.63,0:33:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We could never have done\Nthis without you, Karoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.24,0:33:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Shucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.15,0:33:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You really think a lot of me, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.84,0:33:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop trying to butter me up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.20,0:33:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for teaching us how\Nto continue with treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.04,0:33:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be sure to check on\Nthe wound once in a while
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.16,0:33:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and replace the dressing\Nto keep everything clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.58,0:33:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.49,0:33:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But just so you know, Even changing the\Nbandage is going to be tricky, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.66,0:33:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be as careful as possible, trust us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.68,0:33:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll take care of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.08,0:33:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This mighty creature has been carrying the\Nland of Zo for an entire millennium now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.28,0:33:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoonisha's been part of our\Nlives since the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.22,0:33:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if we've begun to\Ntake that for granted a bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.46,0:33:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,but today our people have\Nlearned a valuable lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.70,0:33:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We were reminded that because\Nof this majestic being,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.32,0:33:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,we have been blessed with a safe place.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.50,0:34:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,to dwell and prosper.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.94,0:34:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And this beast, like all\Nothers, must one day die.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.58,0:34:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, Sunisha.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.50,0:34:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,if Yugara has any will or consciousness,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.58,0:34:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,there is but one question\NI would like to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.82,0:34:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugara have walked for a thousand years.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.82,0:34:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Where exactly are you,\NKaroo, trying to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.64,0:34:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.06,0:34:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd like to stay here on Zo? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.90,0:34:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And what do you mean to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.28,0:34:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I don't know for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.30,0:34:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.32,0:34:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.06,0:34:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If possible, I intend to\Nhave another conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.14,0:34:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,With Zunisha.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.34,0:35:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who's lived a thousand years.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.42,0:35:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish to know why this\Ncreature could hear my voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.52,0:35:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to see if Zunisha knows\Nanything about the Kozuki clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.24,0:35:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.76,0:35:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Do my ears deceive me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.00,0:35:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.52,0:35:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about the ones who\Nawait our return to Wano?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.16,0:35:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fret, Kitomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.74,0:35:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido is still a serious\Nthreat to this country,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.70,0:35:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,so protecting Zo weighs\Nheavily on my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.68,0:35:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And Jack was somehow able to navigate\Nhere and attack us not once, but twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.34,0:35:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be foolish to\Nlet our guard down now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.40,0:35:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A large group like this can't simply\Nroll into Wano all at one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.84,0:35:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's best if I remain here\Nfor a while, but when I do depart,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.72,0:35:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,please come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.86,0:35:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Earlier, Cat Viper created\Na Vever card for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.48,0:36:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Please distribute this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.34,0:36:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I propose that we\Nseparate into four teams.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.44,0:36:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Our mission is to overthrow Kaido, as well\Nas the Shogun who rules the land of Wado.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.92,0:36:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You can navigate there by\Nway of the beaver card.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.70,0:36:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The only issue is correspondence
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.20,0:36:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,in other countries.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.66,0:36:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a strange mollusk.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.62,0:36:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How to explain it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.02,0:36:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It facilitates communication.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.18,0:36:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They're called transponder snails.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.50,0:36:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.46,0:36:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm familiar with them but sadly we\Ndon't have that custom in our country.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.62,0:36:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I noticed a wild\None back in the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.12,0:36:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can go snag one, I'll\Nset it up for you. It's easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.22,0:36:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.44,0:36:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.34,0:36:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.00,0:36:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Viper's house fell apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.50,0:36:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.70,0:36:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me find you!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.08,0:37:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.56,0:37:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.10,0:37:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Viper! Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.82,0:37:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.40,0:37:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Over where?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.31,0:37:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look down!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.04,0:37:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the turtle!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.18,0:37:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me some room!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.18,0:37:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Gonna fell over cover in peace? Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.18,0:37:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.26,0:37:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess you're the turtle viper now!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.60,0:37:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, kid, you always get my name wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.88,0:37:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,but taking out the lion part\Nsomehow makes it even worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.92,0:37:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.83,0:37:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you survive that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.36,0:37:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole building got destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.02,0:37:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I survived, because I'm the\Nman with the power of the Turtle Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.90,0:37:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw my shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.06,0:37:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard and durable like diamond.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.22,0:37:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.22,0:37:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeffers said he would be in charge\Nof making sure you get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.28,0:37:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,so you don't have to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.48,0:37:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.54,0:37:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I was kind of expecting a big reaction\Nto that part about the diamond.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.20,0:37:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.14,0:38:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I do appreciate his help, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.02,0:38:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe an awful lot to you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.38,0:38:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No time to chat!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.14,0:38:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,To Big Mom's house we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.22,0:38:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Slow down, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.14,0:38:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm at the brink of death over\Nhere, so take it easy, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.06,0:38:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.20,0:38:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still recovering! Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.88,0:38:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.48,0:38:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.22,0:38:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.30,0:38:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Of all the guys I gotta hold my life to!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.52,0:38:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.36,0:38:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Pedro?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.96,0:38:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji saved our entire country.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.24,0:38:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And he was abducted\Nright here on our soil.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.32,0:38:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we can't take many,\Nbut I have one request.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.36,0:39:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Peccombs mustn't be the only member of the\NMink tribe to accompany the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.02,0:39:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.16,0:39:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You, Karoo, would like to join\NLuffy on his trip? Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.30,0:39:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast there, Pedro!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.78,0:39:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You dare upstage us?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.80,0:39:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This task is better suited to my\Ngroup, the Dark Storm Musketeers!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.20,0:39:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it, Shanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.64,0:39:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This is supposed to be a stealth mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.14,0:39:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're an insufferable loudmouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.02,0:39:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did that come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.16,0:39:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, sir, I should go along.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.34,0:39:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been with the Straw\NHats since they got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.72,0:39:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.63,0:39:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Send me as Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.78,0:39:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper's assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.00,0:39:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a minute. But wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.40,0:39:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We became good friends with Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.36,0:39:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us go!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.80,0:39:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,After attacking him...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.54,0:39:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.78,0:39:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami likes sleeping on my stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.76,0:39:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that got to do with anything, Yomo?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.42,0:40:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Choose me so I can nibble on Baron Corpse's\Nbones whenever I want. And me. And me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.32,0:40:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just plain selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.38,0:40:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys aren't coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.78,0:40:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I know exactly how you gotta feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.46,0:40:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But the wisest thing to\Ndo is to let Pedro go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.48,0:40:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But why? Him, master! Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.94,0:40:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Peckoms will be going.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.42,0:40:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Only Pedro can keep him in check.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.28,0:40:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I see no other option.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.20,0:40:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What is all this excitement about?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.50,0:40:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we used the word perfect to\Ndescribe one of the previous models,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.44,0:40:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,but my latest creation blows\Nthem all out of the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.64,0:40:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.80,0:40:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I incorporated the growth\Ncapability of Pop Green,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.60,0:40:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and Franky lent me some of his\Nexpertise for the surface treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.64,0:41:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to say it's the\Ngreatest invention of the century,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.82,0:41:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,but that wouldn't be wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.88,0:41:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you listening, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.72,0:41:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What happens when I squeeze it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.70,0:41:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.70,0:41:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't use this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.94,0:41:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You made it wait too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.08,0:41:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's an improved climate\Nattack that can change
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.00,0:41:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,its length when you apply\Na tiny amount of pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.60,0:41:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a feature, not a bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.52,0:41:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.00,0:41:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I mixed in different elements from all the
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.20,0:41:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Weatheria gadgets I got\Nfrom you and Zeff Odi.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.66,0:41:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There's just one thing, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.42,0:41:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember what you said to me\Nabout your other climate attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.48,0:42:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like having a magic wand.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.10,0:42:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't understand what you meant then.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.90,0:42:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.26,0:42:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the perfect fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.76,0:42:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stop talking now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.38,0:42:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I love this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.32,0:42:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Some skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.44,0:42:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be highly advanced in jutsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.32,0:42:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.04,0:42:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like you took all the science\Nof Weatheria to the absolute limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.62,0:42:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the sorcery climate\Nact I've always dreamed about.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.84,0:42:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.75,0:42:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.67,0:42:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No trouble at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.98,0:42:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.34,0:42:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, the materials weren't free, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.06,0:42:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's try a mirage tempo. You cheapskate!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.92,0:42:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess this is everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.44,0:42:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Pierre, you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.36,0:42:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Pedro, but yes, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.40,0:42:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, hey, nobody told me\Nhe was coming. Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.98,0:42:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd better tag along, since I've\Nknown you, Karoo, for such a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.74,0:42:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean? Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.06,0:43:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Kashi!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.28,0:43:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami, please be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.18,0:43:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.68,0:43:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.40,0:43:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.80,0:43:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Best of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.68,0:43:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.80,0:43:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's him we're talking about, so\Nhe might be happy about all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.06,0:43:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, maybe that idiot skirt\Nchaser does want to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.00,0:43:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.32,0:43:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But I guess you're not wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.64,0:43:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm sure it'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.42,0:43:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Luffy, fare thee well.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.40,0:43:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall wait for you in the Land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.68,0:43:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do your best, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.66,0:43:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Go out of trouble, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.92,0:43:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Be sure to let us know\Nif anything bad happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.78,0:43:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make some bad-ass weapons\Nso we can go whoop-kado!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.30,0:43:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll round up every last samurai\Nthe Land of Wano has to offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.70,0:43:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.98,0:43:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.12,0:43:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to assist you with the descent.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.58,0:43:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, that's okay. We got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.24,0:44:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.64,0:44:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.44,0:44:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get Sanji back before you know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.26,0:44:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,See you guys when we get to Wado. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.66,0:44:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful around Big Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.56,0:44:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a good reason she's an emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.28,0:44:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.70,0:44:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,With Luffy leading the charge,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.72,0:44:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,the Sanji Retrieval Team sets\Nout for Whole Cake Island,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.82,0:45:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,where Luffy will face off against\Nformidable former adversary, Big Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.62,0:45:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, on the Grand Line, in the\NKingdom of San called Alabasta...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.26,0:45:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.52,0:45:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Slow down, Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.48,0:45:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you in such a good mood?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.08,0:45:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.12,0:45:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time\Nsince I went out to sea.
